{{/*
  The account menu, for both headers: the admin's, and the public site's for a
  browser signed in to the admin (see accountMenu). A <details> rather than a
  scripted dropdown: it opens and closes with no JavaScript of ours, from the
  keyboard as well as the mouse.

  "account_menu_open" and "account_menu_close" go around whatever links the
  caller adds first — the public site's menu leads with a way into the admin —
  and the close carries what every menu has: your profile settings and signing
  out. Two halves rather than one template with a flag, because html/template
  passes a single value and a flag in the page data would be for this alone.

  Signing out is a POST with the CSRF token, as it always was; from the
  public site the fragment is rendered under the same nosurf pool, so the token
  is good there too.
*/}}
{{define "account_menu_open"}}
<details class="account-menu">
  <summary aria-label="Account menu for {{.User.Display}}" data-tooltip="Profile settings">{{template "profile_icon"}}</summary>
  <div class="menu">
    <p class="who"><strong>{{.User.Display}}</strong>{{if ne .User.Display .User.Email}}<br><small>{{.User.Email}}</small>{{end}}</p>
{{end}}

{{define "account_menu_close"}}
    <a href="/admin/account">Profile settings</a>
    <form method="post" action="/admin/logout">
      {{template "csrf" .CSRFToken}}
      <button type="submit">Sign out</button>
    </form>
  </div>
</details>
{{end}}

{{/*
  The profile icon. A line drawing in currentColor, sized and stroked by
  styles.css (.profile-icon). Decorative: the control around it carries the
  accessible name.

  It carries its size and stroke as attributes too — SVG presentation
  attributes, which any CSS rule overrides — for a theme whose stylesheet
  predates this icon. Without them an unstyled inline SVG is drawn 300×150 and
  filled solid black, which is how a copied stylesheet first met it.
*/}}
{{define "profile_icon"}}<svg class="profile-icon" width="22" height="22" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.75" stroke-linecap="round" aria-hidden="true" focusable="false"><circle cx="12" cy="8" r="4"/><path d="M4 21c0-4.4 3.6-8 8-8s8 3.6 8 8"/></svg>{{end}}
